# Tyvar's first ability taps ANOTHER untapped creature YOU control (a cost, so a summoning-sick Woodland Changeling may pay it),
# then taps Tyvar itself. Alone on turn 1 Tyvar cannot pay with itself, and on turn 3 Bot2's untapped Keral Keep Disciples is
# no creature of Bot1's. Once the Changeling is cast, Bot2 bolts the untapped Tyvar and Bot1 pays with the Changeling: Tyvar
# survives 3 damage indestructible and ends tapped. On turn 4 the protection has ended with the turn, and a second Bolt
# destroys Tyvar. (CR 118.3, 107.5, 702.12b, 611.2a)

